"It's Africa not Australia\nSeparated from India\n\nHills emerged many from it\nRiver flowed from a single giant\nNobody knows the water's origin\nYet we discuss about the quaint\n\nYes the range is comfy here\nYet carries remains of Africa\nThe latter, it cannot comprehend\nMight miss early Himalaya\n\nEruptions must've occured in past\nYet they stayed always together\nYes, the present is more beautiful\nBut the 'ago' will stay forever\n\nNow we have the exposure\nAnd the snowy hills here\nThis separation, the river flowed\nThe mount is now puzzled here"